  "year": 2024,
  "arxivId": "2407.07614",
  "abstract": "MARS is a novel framework for text-to-image synthesis that leverages a mixture of auto-regressive models to generate high-quality images. By combining large language models with vision generation capabilities, MARS achieves state-of-the-art performance on various benchmarks, including MS-COCO and T2I-CompBench. The model's efficiency and effectiveness are demonstrated through a series of experiments and ablation studies.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The Core Idea",
      "content": "MARS introduces a <strong>Semantic Vision-Language Integration Expert (SemVIE)</strong> module, which seamlessly integrates pre-trained large language models with visual understanding and generation capabilities. This innovative component enables the model to preserve the natural language processing proficiency of LLMs while endowing them with state-of-the-art visual comprehension and generation capabilities.",
