    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "MARS employs a <strong>multi-stage refinement training strategy</strong>, which involves pre-training for text-to-image alignment, high-quality data alignment, and high-resolution refinement. The model uses a combination of next token prediction and next K-token prediction to generate high-quality images that closely adhere to the semantic content of the text prompts.",
